{"id":"klemme","lemma":"Klemme","pos":"noun","rank":3784,"glosses":["clamp","grip","difficult situation, predicament"],"ipa":"/ˈklɛmə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e3/De-Klemme.ogg/De-Klemme.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Klemme","plural":"Klemmen"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir helfen einander immer aus der Klemme.","en":"We always help each other out.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to help"},{"g":"Reciprocal pronoun of…"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Er steckt arg in der Klemme.","en":"He's in big trouble.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to stick","l":"stecken"},{"g":"bad"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Da säße ich ganz schön in der Klemme.","en":"That would leave me in a fix.","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to sit","l":"sitzen"},{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"pretty, quite, rather"]]},{"text":"Ich stecke in der Klemme, da mein Geld gestohlen wurde.","en":"I am in a bind as my money has been stolen.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to stick","l":"stecken"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"to steal","l":"stehlen"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]},{"text":"Tom steckte finanziell in der Klemme.","en":"Tom was in trouble financially.","words":[null,{"g":"to stick","l":"stecken"},{"g":"financial"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}